# filters: optional. Duplicacy include/exclude patterns, one per line, selecting what of
# this service directory is backed up. Without it, everything is.
# See https://forum.duplicacy.com/t/filters-include-exclude-patterns/1089 for the syntax.
#
# For example, back up compose.yaml and the hooks, and nothing else:
#
# +compose.yaml
# +pre-backup
# +post-backup
# +post-restore
# -*
